Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收下这个娃娃就是一个天大的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a big mistake acknowledging this doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦它到了你的手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And through that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无形的恶灵就迷惑了你的心智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the inhuman spirit tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你允许它入侵你的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it permission to infest your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无形的恶灵是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's an inhuman spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一种不会以人形存在的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something that's never walked the earth in human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一种邪恶的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something demonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个娃娃没有被附身吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the doll was never possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 这个娃娃只是一个媒介\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was used as a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它几经易手 让人误以为是她被附身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was moved around to give the impression of possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶灵不会附身在东西上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demonic spirits don't possess things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只会附身在人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They possess people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它想要占据你的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wanted to get inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基于这种特殊的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And given this unusual feature,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个娃娃需要进行妥善的存放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the doll will need to be properly cared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妥善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cared for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这娃娃就该被毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只会让事态恶化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would only make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们觉得最好还是由我们带走这个娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think it best the doll come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会把它放在安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll keep it somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来是个不错的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是你们的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我的梦 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The dreams I hold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 是金色的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Is a band of gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 而爱留下的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And the memories ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 这些记忆 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Of what love could be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得还有多久能到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer, do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概还有一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是把座椅放下来休息一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you put your head back? Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你从超市回家都能迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you get lost coming home from the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.25,0:02:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是睡着的话 醒来我们就在加州了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I do that, we might end up in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你醒来就能听到太平洋的声音了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, so you wake up to the sound of the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有什么不好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能顺路接上朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pick up Judy on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来很棒 爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that actually sounds so nice, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该好好计划一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should plan on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们得掉头 前头发生了很严重的交通事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You folks need to turn around. Pretty bad accident up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能帮什么忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是医生什么的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You a doctor or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他只是想说我们很乐意帮忙 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He just meant if you need an extra set of hands. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能搞定 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it covered. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娃娃不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不错而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们得回到三英里前的那个出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you're gonna head three miles back to the last exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们转26号路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll hop on 26,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以绕道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that'll loop you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 26号路 明白了 - 谢谢 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 26. Got it. - Thank you, Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一个路人和他的娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A guy and his doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们开过头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we missed our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 布里奇沃特路就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't miss it. Bridgewater's just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么布里奇沃特路 我们要去老布里奇路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bridgewater? Old Ridge Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会觉得是布里奇沃特路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get Bridgewater from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我觉得我们是开过头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know what? I think we missed our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会留心找太平洋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep my eye out for the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爱德 - 别急 别急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ed? - Hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打开前盖看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pop the hood and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(玛丽威尔公墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚遭遇了一场交通意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were just in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搭错线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wires crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(玛丽威尔公墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样应该好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的车好像突然着了魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of a sudden it was like somebody took over my truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制不了 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no control. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个娃娃 爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the doll, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是召唤其他灵体的灯塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a beacon for other spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 神父 越快越好 - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father, sooner the better. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要自作聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be not wise in thine own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬畏耶和华 远离恶事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear the Lord and depart from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华咒诅恶人的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The curse of the Lord is in the house of the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赐福与义人的居所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But He blesseth the habitation of the just.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他讥诮那好讥诮的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely, He scorneth the scorners,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赐恩给谦卑的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but He giveth grace unto the lowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.49,0:10:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智慧人必承受尊荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wise shall inherit the glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚昧人高升也成为羞辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but shame shall be the promotion of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还需要一层防护屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need another barrier of protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣洁的屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A holy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈祷的效果有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blessing will only do so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三一教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That chapel glass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被毁前的教堂玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we got from Trinity Church before it was torn down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"原谅他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let us forgive those
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们的侵犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who trespass against us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并使我们不受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lead us not into temptation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪恶的诱惑"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but deliver us from evil."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有用吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪恶被压抑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evil is contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃伦收藏室是全世界最大的收藏遭到鬼魂影响和诅咒物件的收藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于其藏有及极其邪恶的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃伦夫妇每周会该收藏室进行祈祷赐福
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收藏室中的每件物品都有其独一无二的恐怖来历
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是沃伦夫妇认为其中有一件物品蕴含的邪恶力量远甚于其他...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《安娜贝尔3: 回家》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(一年后)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英雄还是骗子 争议驱魔引发热议)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到玛丽·艾伦的车停着了 去拿好你的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw Mary Ellen pull up. Go and get your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是先把你的麦片放...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first put your cereal in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英雄还是骗子 争议驱魔引发热议)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订披萨的钱放在柜子上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pizza money is on the counter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,号码就在电话机边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and numbers are by the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天一大早就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll be back early tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不用着急 我们没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, and take your time, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对吧 朱蒂 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right, Judy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你会... - 乖乖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, you'll... - Behave? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你会记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll remember to go to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得准时上床睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember to go to bed on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧 别忘了... - 好好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, don't forget to... - To have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 也对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - That, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是排练好的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you guys rehearse that, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(圣托马斯 天主教学校)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球呼叫朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth to Judy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有几个小时就到周末了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just a couple more hours until the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要趁有空赶紧去超市买点吃用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna run to the market for supplies during my free period.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就来接你 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pick you up after, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds super.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Judy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过得愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法雷太太 就在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Faley, it's right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英雄还是骗子 争议驱魔引发热议)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能不告诉我 沃伦夫妇到底是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you not tell me what the Warrens did for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在不是应该在上数学课吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't you be in math class?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当初给史密斯夫妇当了两年保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I babysat the Smiths for over two years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没告诉过你他们是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never told you what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他们是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what do they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是足疗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're podiatrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这完全不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我等下肯定要来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, obviously, I'm coming over later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要一起完成一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do have that social studies project
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社会调研\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we need to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有什么调研\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have any project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他们怎么会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, but how would they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可会通灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他们就是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, they're heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他们只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're concerned parents
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不希望自己的孩子受到负面影响的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who wouldn't want negative influences
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一对操心的父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around their child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么负面影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What negative influence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为我有时候会过了宵禁时间才回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I sometimes stay out past curfew?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那房子里是什么样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's it like inside the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是恐怖的音乐和蜘蛛网吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it all creepy music and cobwebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 就是乏味的郊区房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, it's boring suburbia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连你的储物柜都比那里恐怖点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inside of your locker is scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 谁要开派对 怎么没邀请我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Whose party, and why wasn't I invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂的生日快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy's birthday is coming up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们要提前庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we're gonna celebrate early.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的是最棒的保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are the best babysitter, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍马屁也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliments will get you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那威胁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about threats?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有注意到谁在收银呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you, uh, happen to notice who's working checkout?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you so much. - See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他们都管他叫什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they call him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大胆鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob's- Got- Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mary Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这些了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想是的 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think so. - Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你住在沃伦家附近吧 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live near the Warrens, don't you, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 玛丽·艾伦今晚要去他们家做保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Mary Ellen's babysitting for them tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我就住在他们家对面那条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, I live right across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有注意到他们家有什么恐怖的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you ever see anything scary over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a ghost, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法雷太太在五号货架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Faley went ahead and dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄撒了一罐番茄酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a can of tomato sauce in aisle five,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那看上去就像是犯罪现场 去拿拖把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it looks like a crime scene, so get the mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 你们还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies. Did you find everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃没给你们惹什么麻烦把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob here is not giving you any trouble, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 交给我吧 谢谢 爸爸 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I got it. Thanks, Dad. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it right after.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你都看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what'd you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在沃伦家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the Warrens'?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一共3.5美元 那么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, your total is $3.50, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你早就知道沃伦夫妇是干什么的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you knew what the Warrens did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有一些传言 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were rumors, I guess, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传言 有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumors. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道也有关于你的传言吗 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know there's a rumor going around about you, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 真的吗 什么传言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, really? What is it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是关于一个女孩...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's about a girl who has a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你可以来 住口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. You can come. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都是我不好 - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's totally my fault. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 鲍勃 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Bob. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她忘了拿她的蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she forgot her eggs, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会被服身的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是附身 - 我说的就是附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's "possessed." - That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你懂这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyways, if you know so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不如告诉我们 你能不能抓到鬼身上的虱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why don't you tell us if you can catch cooties from a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抓不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你怎么抓呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then how'd you get 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.97,0:19:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安东尼·莱欧斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony Rios!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我把你姐姐叫过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me get your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就走开 你们都走开 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then go. All of you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:19:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我去不了你的生日派对了 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I can't come to your birthday party, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也来不了了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't either?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父母说我还没有做好 面对死亡的准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents said I'm not really prepared to process death yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是生日派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你收到这种待遇多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how long has that been happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从大家这周都知道那篇文章的事以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since everyone heard about the article this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求你不要告诉我父母 - 我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please don't tell my parents. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你不让我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't as long as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不希望他们担心 - 他们是父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want them to worry. - They're parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管需不需要担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're worried about everything
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都会担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether they need to be or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(纪念迈克尔·莫里塞神父)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你现在的烦心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure the bullying is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有受同学欺负吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only thing that's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是烦心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That isn't bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.99,0:20:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我们说好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去超市买了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you get at the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说没有秘密的 - 惊喜不是秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said no secrets. - A surprise isn't a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 是惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it then? - It's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会弄得一团糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给蛋糕留点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save some for the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有人在敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's someone at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敲了十分钟的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was knocking on the door for, like, ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you even get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是灵铃吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a spirit bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是灵铃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a spirit bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:14.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会告诉你你身边有没有灵体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tells you if you're in the presence of any spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那的确是咯 - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, it is one. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一个铃铛 我妈妈喜欢收集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a bell. My mom collects them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是丹妮拉 她吃完蛋糕就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's Daniela, and she leaves after cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸妈会不会留着些什么恐怖的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't your parents, like, keep any creepy stuff around?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.18,0:22:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把那些东西都锁在一个房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They keep it all locked away in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们至少能进去看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, can we at least go in and look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.43,0:22:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.31,0:22:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个房间不该进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not really good for anyone to go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:22:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪来的钱买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you even afford those?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我自己旧的那双\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're my old ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.51,0:23:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我只用过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I only ever used them once
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.55,0:23:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我第一次穿上就摔断了胳膊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I broke my arm the first time I put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看上去协调性比我好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looks way more coordinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.35,0:23:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会划坏地板的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna ruin the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们能去街上玩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go around the block, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得不该... - 好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think... - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.98,0:23:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会盯着蛋糕 确保不会烤糊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll watch the cake and make sure it doesn't burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.61,0:23:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 但是不要随意乱逛 不要乱碰东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. But don't snoop. Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别做 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do anything. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在厨房里 你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in the kitchen. Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(沃伦夫妇恶魔巫术事物咨询所)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(危险 请勿触碰任何东西)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请求另一边的鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am calling out to the spirits on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请打开这扇门 让我进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please unlock this door and let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要批判我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.27,0:26:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(黑皮)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.28,0:27:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(触觉配对)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.63,0:28:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会被关在这里面呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do to get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.30,0:30:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这个房间里面有鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is a presence here in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.80,0:30:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请给我一个征兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please give me a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.52,0:30:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何征兆都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any sign at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.48,0:30:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太愚蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(警告 绝对 不要 打开)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.43,0:32:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把蛋糕烤糊了 丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burnt the cake? Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放点糖霜上去就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just put frosting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.85,0:33:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.47,0:33:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮滑鞋玩得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd it go with the skates?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很喜欢 直到她在回来的路上摔了一跤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She loved them until she fell on the way back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蹭破了膝盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and skinned her knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总比摔断了手好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than breaking her arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.23,0:33:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在在哪里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在外面喂鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's out feeding the chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.44,0:33:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还养了鸡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have chickens?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.70,0:33:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的膝盖怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your knee?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来至少你的牛仔裤需要缝几针了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like your jeans will at least need some stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会有意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accidents happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.54,0:33:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经害怕了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, are you scared yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.05,0:33:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕 什么 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scared? What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.84,0:33:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说他们害怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who says they're scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我班上的同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.68,0:33:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安东尼·莱欧斯先开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony Rios started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 托尼·莱欧斯开始的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Tony Rios started it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.10,0:33:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.23,0:33:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他是我弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.06,0:34:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安东尼·莱欧斯是你的弟弟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony Rios is your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.23,0:34:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂 别把他和我相提并论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. Don't hold it against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.44,0:34:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.95,0:34:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 他现在还尿床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he still wets the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.53,0:34:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可别说是我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't hear it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也可以说 我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you did, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.58,0:34:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.21,0:34:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太为难他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go a little easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.62,0:34:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年发生了很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a tough year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.05,0:34:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去了某个人 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost somebody, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.59,0:34:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦和你说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Mary Ellen tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.06,0:34:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.10,0:34:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.73,0:34:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, for delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.81,0:34:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想点个大号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I do one large, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.57,0:34:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是维曼街3506号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, it's gonna be 3506 Wayman Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.82,0:34:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, perfect. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.67,0:34:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别着急啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.97,0:35:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.27,0:35:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.23,0:35:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.11,0:35:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安娜贝尔在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Annabelle there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安娜贝尔能出来玩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can Annabelle come out to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.26,0:35:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你走错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you have the wrong house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.39,0:35:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有叫安娜贝尔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no Annabelle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.81,0:36:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.69,0:36:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就在你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.33,0:36:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们总是...他们对死亡的态度好奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are just... They're really weird about death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.41,0:36:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许学校里的孩子正是因此才找你麻烦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably why the kids pick on you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It scares them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.71,0:36:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把死亡看做一种谁都不想沾染的疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They treat it like it's some disease they don't wanna get,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.00,0:36:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便其实人人都有这种病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even though everyone already has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.01,0:36:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.97,0:36:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前都认为死了就是一命呜呼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to think it was fatal and whammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.80,0:36:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, like, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.93,0:36:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像关掉了电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like turning off a TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.97,0:36:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我知道了你父母的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I learned about your parents
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.22,0:36:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他们对死后之事 这类东西的探索...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their whole exploration into the afterlife and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.81,0:36:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们给了我希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they gave me hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.52,0:36:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许生命还是会继续的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That maybe life goes on somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.74,0:36:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲爱的爸爸还在某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my darling dad is still out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"亲爱的爸爸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Darling dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.62,0:36:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们之间的称呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.24,0:37:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是亲爱的爸爸 我是亲爱的丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was darling dad, and I was darling Daniela...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.13,0:37:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在某个地方的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still out there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.09,0:37:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么认为吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸妈妈也会说他在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents would say he is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.30,0:37:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.82,0:37:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.85,0:38:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.78,0:38:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.70,0:38:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去哪里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.08,0:38:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉 你不能下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela, you're not supposed to go down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.29,0:38:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 - 我以为我看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - I thought I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.61,0:40:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(想我吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.29,0:41:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.88,0:41:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.85,0:41:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.23,0:41:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.78,0:41:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华啊 我信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In thee, O Lord, do I put my trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你凭你的公义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me never be put to confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.99,0:41:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搭救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deliver me into Thy righteousness
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.70,0:41:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救拔我 侧耳听...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cause me to escape. Incline Thine ear...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.41,0:41:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, Judy! Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.20,0:41:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.71,0:41:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.84,0:42:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.09,0:42:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.59,0:42:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.09,0:42:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.85,0:42:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scared of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.31,0:42:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.85,0:42:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会看到一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.19,0:42:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我妈妈会看到一些东西一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like how my mom sees things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.78,0:42:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说鬼魂之类的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean like ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.12,0:42:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在哪里看到它们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.87,0:42:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去哪儿都能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.55,0:42:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼魂也曾经是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghosts used to be people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.93,0:42:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你遇到的每个人都不一定是坏人 所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not every person you meet is bad... so
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.14,0:42:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许不一定每个鬼魂都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe not all ghosts are bad, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得来看看这个 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to see this. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.20,0:43:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是沃伦夫妇以前接手的一次调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this case the Warrens investigated about this girl
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.53,0:43:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于一个被摆渡人吓到的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was terrorized by something called the Ferryman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.08,0:43:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他杀死的那个女孩的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a picture of the girl he killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.91,0:43:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去眼熟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.08,0:43:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩很可能是姐妹呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you two could be sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.21,0:43:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有兴趣的话 这是剩余的档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the rest of the file, if you want to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.64,0:43:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.85,0:43:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.81,0:43:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是黑皮的档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is the file on the Black Shuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.36,0:43:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Shuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.57,0:43:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是沃伦夫妇曾今去英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a case the Warrens investigated
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.36,0:43:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调查一个人被一只猎犬附身的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about a hellhound that possessed a man in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个镇子都被他吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He terrorized the shit out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.60,0:43:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(可能是猎犬 迷雾 圣玛丽教堂 公墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.34,0:44:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们眼睛上的硬币是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the coins over their eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.17,0:44:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.88,0:44:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没有了解得这么深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't know. I didn't get that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.34,0:44:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们以前都会在死人眼睛上放硬币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used to put them over the eyes of the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.22,0:44:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让摆渡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to pay the Ferryman,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.05,0:44:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他的灵魂前往阴间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he could take their souls to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他的摆渡费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was his toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.06,0:44:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该离开这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.23,0:44:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我有时候也喜欢偷溜进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I sometimes like to snoop, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.60,0:44:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这是干什么的吗 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what this does, Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.23,0:44:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这应该是吊唁者手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's called a Mourner's Bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.03,0:44:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能让你联系你过世的爱着的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It helps you contact your lost loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.41,0:44:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.38,0:44:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我爸爸妈妈最近在调查的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a case my parents investigated recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.75,0:44:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件婚纱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.62,0:44:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会缠上人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It haunts people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.01,0:44:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让人变得很暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it makes them violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.35,0:44:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这件婚纱现在在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the dress now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.76,0:44:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走廊尽头的收藏室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down the hall in the artifact room.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.35,0:45:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 这种东西都在那房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's where all this stuff is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.77,0:45:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Judy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.90,0:45:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前就是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.32,0:45:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.36,0:45:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸说你那里面的所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad says that everything in there
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.61,0:45:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是遭到鬼魂影响 就是被诅咒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is either haunted, cursed,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.28,0:45:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者用在某种仪式中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or used in some ritualistic practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.58,0:45:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里面的那个娃娃呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the doll that's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.87,0:45:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我看过你爸爸的一篇采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I read this interview with your dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.58,0:45:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.13,0:45:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要提她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.67,0:45:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.97,0:45:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被关起来是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in a case for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.60,0:45:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们该离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.31,0:45:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看这里有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what's on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.10,0:45:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 丹妮拉 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Daniela! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.77,0:45:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你 不洁的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you, unclean spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.48,0:45:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你的仆从一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with all your minions...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.65,0:45:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.90,0:45:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从我的每一个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to obey me to the letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.41,0:45:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.37,0:46:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去找点别的事做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.49,0:46:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找点合适的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something that's actually appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.58,0:46:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.33,0:46:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你至少想听听那武士装的故事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't you at least wanna hear about the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.09,0:46:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.26,0:46:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.38,0:46:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不记得我玩过这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.26,0:46:17.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:19.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.69,0:46:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你要抽一张卡片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, so you draw a card
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.90,0:46:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要通过你的触觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whatever picture it has on it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.27,0:46:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在盒子里找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the object you try to find
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.44,0:46:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你卡片上的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by feeling around inside the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.40,0:46:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你抽出来的东西就是卡片上的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the object you pull out matches the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.11,0:46:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就能得一分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you get a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.20,0:46:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.45,0:46:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.90,0:47:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去应门吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.28,0:47:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.78,0:47:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 你们继续玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, you guys keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.95,0:47:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得一分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.91,0:47:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.35,0:47:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.45,0:48:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mary Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.12,0:48:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.79,0:48:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记不记得在超市里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember how, at the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.50,0:48:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉说你会来这里做保姆吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela said that you were babysitting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.42,0:48:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.38,0:48:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
