Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.59,0:54:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.67,0:54:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.72,0:54:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.31,0:54:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.27,0:54:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.94,0:54:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他是回家练习去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully he went home to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.99,0:54:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 回床上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Back up to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.61,0:54:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.00,0:55:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能让我留下来 我能更安心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd feel better if you let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.00,0:55:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以早点起来 我们都不用告诉朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can wake up early. We don't even have to tell Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.58,0:55:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.33,0:55:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.75,0:55:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.71,0:55:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.84,0:55:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你让朱蒂好受多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually think it helped Judy a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.59,0:55:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉没让你看到什么蜘蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry you didn't get to see any cobwebs
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.93,0:55:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或听到什么可怕的音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or hear any creepy music.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.18,0:55:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少鲍勃那一出还是有点可怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the Bob thing was kind of creepy, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.85,0:55:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果鲍勃半夜来敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if Bob comes knocking on this door late at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.69,0:55:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就放飞自我 让他进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forget you're you for a minute and let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.57,0:55:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天给我打电话 分享细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me tomorrow and tell me the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.32,0:55:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好分享的细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no details to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.22,0:56:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.02,0:57:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的爸爸是怎么死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd her dad die?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.18,0:57:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不该把这当做睡前故事来讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if that's the best bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.69,0:57:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看我爸妈是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who my parents are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.65,0:57:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.36,0:57:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.40,0:57:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简短的版本就是 他死于车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the short of it is that he died in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.62,0:57:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多说一两句就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the long of it is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.95,0:57:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时开车的人是丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela was driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.25,0:57:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的错吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it her fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.96,0:57:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.46,0:57:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one person
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.50,0:57:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得是她的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who actually thinks it was her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.57,0:59:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.49,0:59:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再来试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.33,1:00:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这里有鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is a presence here...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.37,1:00:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.53,1:01:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.49,1:01:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你害死我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did this to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.58,1:01:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.12,1:02:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.11,1:02:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(危险 请勿触碰任何东西)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.75,1:02:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你害死我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did this to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.66,1:02:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.79,1:02:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 不 别走 别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, no, no. Don't go. Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.76,1:02:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.93,1:02:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 过来 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, come here. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.44,1:03:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.97,1:05:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.23,1:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是这样把她从橱子里抓走的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why he picked her up from the closet?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:05:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 肯定是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. That must have been it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.98,1:06:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把她从橱里抓走 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna pick her up in a closet, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.15,1:06:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你待在这里 不要出声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay here and don't make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.90,1:08:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.45,1:08:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.33,1:08:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的咖啡呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my coffee?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.63,1:08:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你遇到了超自然...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been experiencing supernatural...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.00,1:08:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 我的咖啡呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. Where's my coffee?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.59,1:08:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.43,1:08:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的眼睛上有银色的硬币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had silver coins for his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.97,1:08:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说他的光能指引你前往死亡之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said his light shows you the way to the land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.27,1:08:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想找到我的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna find my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.90,1:08:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她第一次看到他是什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when did she first see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.65,1:08:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他抓走她不久前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long before he took her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.15,1:08:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说她醒来 他就在她的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she'd wake up, and he'd be in her room...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.99,1:08:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着她睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.99,1:08:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不见的那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night she went missing,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.91,1:08:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都被一个声音吵醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we both woke up to a noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.62,1:09:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去像是硬币掉到地板上的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounded like a coin falling on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.38,1:09:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要我在房间里等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me to wait in her room.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.92,1:09:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就等着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.97,1:09:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她再也没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.14,1:09:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就去找她 结果走到了一个长长的走廊上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to look for her and ended up in a long hallway.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.64,1:09:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走廊里全是棺材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Filled with coffins.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.98,1:09:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.23,1:09:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又被一个声音吵醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I woke up to a noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.61,1:09:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一枚硬币落地的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another coin being dropped.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.07,1:09:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like he was...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.37,1:09:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像在召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like he was calling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.87,1:09:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有见到过摆渡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever seen the Ferryman?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.41,1:09:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付他摆渡费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay his toll,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.92,1:09:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就会夺走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.71,1:09:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付他摆渡费 他就会夺走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay his toll, he'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.80,1:09:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付他摆渡费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay his toll,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.47,1:09:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就会夺走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.22,1:10:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付他摆渡费 他就会夺走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay his toll, he'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.48,1:10:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不付他摆渡费 他就会夺走你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't pay his toll, he'll take your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.42,1:13:57.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 该死 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Shit! Shit! No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.77,1:14:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.73,1:14:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.52,1:15:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.52,1:15:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 开门 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! Open the door, Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.68,1:16:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your dolls.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.06,1:17:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.40,1:17:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从后门出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.00,1:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.17,1:17:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.63,1:17:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 沃伦太太 - 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Warren? - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.21,1:17:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen? Judy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.51,1:17:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都还好吗 没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.09,1:17:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.18,1:17:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的房子里发生了一些奇怪的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is happening inside your house
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.14,1:17:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们现在出去不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't think it's safe to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.35,1:17:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not really sure what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.77,1:17:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我和安娜贝尔说说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I speak to Annabelle?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.77,1:17:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.32,1:17:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要给她一个灵魂 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to give her a soul, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.61,1:17:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 一个灵魂 她要她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - A soul. She wants her soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.12,1:17:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me her soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.51,1:19:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.01,1:19:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.01,1:19:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.94,1:19:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(想我吗)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.95,1:20:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安娜贝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Annabelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.49,1:20:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个娃娃 这一切都是她干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doll. She's the one who's doing all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.91,1:20:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A doll?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.66,1:20:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想要一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.21,1:20:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想再见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.09,1:20:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.93,1:20:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想告诉他我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to tell him I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.43,1:20:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那就是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.23,1:20:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.44,1:20:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.86,1:20:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把她放了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.57,1:20:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还碰了什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else did you touch?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.54,1:20:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.84,1:20:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Run! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.30,1:21:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.43,1:21:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的哮喘 她发作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's her asthma. She's having an attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.81,1:21:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸入器在她的车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inhaler's in her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.81,1:21:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.60,1:21:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Let me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.61,1:22:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.09,1:23:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.80,1:23:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.10,1:23:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.02,1:23:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉呢 她本来在你后面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Daniela? She came after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.53,1:23:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen? Judy?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.82,1:23:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在这里 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm up here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.03,1:23:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.70,1:23:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西控制住她了 我能感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something has a hold of her. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.33,1:23:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.21,1:23:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要找到安娜贝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find Annabelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.88,1:23:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把她放回到盒子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to put her back in the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.26,1:23:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道她在哪里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.68,1:23:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.66,1:24:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 朱蒂 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, Judy, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.59,1:24:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有鬼都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all ghosts are bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.84,1:24:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.78,1:24:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有鬼都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all ghosts are bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.82,1:24:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有鬼都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all ghosts are bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.99,1:24:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有鬼都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all ghosts are bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.58,1:24:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有鬼都是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all ghosts are bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.30,1:25:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.39,1:25:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.83,1:26:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.01,1:26:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拿她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.98,1:26:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No! Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.07,1:26:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母把钥匙放在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do your parents keep the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.53,1:26:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 这上面从来没锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It's never locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.76,1:27:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道钥匙在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where the key is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.35,1:27:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来拿 - 不 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get it. - No! No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.52,1:27:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.58,1:27:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.33,1:27:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.70,1:28:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在天的父 愿你的名被尊为圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Father, who art in heaven hallowed be Thy name.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.28,1:29:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.70,1:30:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们日用的饮食 今日赐给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us this day our daily bread,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.91,1:30:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免我们的债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and forgive us for our trespasses
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.20,1:30:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同我们免了人的债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we forgive those who trespassed against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.79,1:30:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.64,1:30:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.85,1:30:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.98,1:30:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.12,1:31:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.25,1:31:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.47,1:31:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你 不洁的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you, unclean spirit,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.18,1:31:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一同冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with all your minions,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.14,1:31:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝仆从的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now attacking this servant of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.94,1:31:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我命令你听从我的每一个字 - 朱蒂 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I command you to obey me to the letter. - Judy, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.02,1:31:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以祂之名 他们将用祂之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his name, they will take up serpents...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.65,1:31:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铲除毒蛇 责罚邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with his hands and condemn all evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.07,1:31:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你 不洁的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you, unclean spirit,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.16,1:31:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with all your minions,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.95,1:31:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听从我的每一个字 - 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To obey me to the letter. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.45,1:31:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 上帝的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, who am a servant of God...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.08,1:32:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你 不洁的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you, unclean spirit,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.21,1:32:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一同冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with all your minions,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.42,1:32:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝的仆从的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now attacking this servant of God...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.41,1:32:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.84,1:32:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 朱蒂 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! Judy. Judy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.97,1:32:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去拿娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the doll!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.85,1:33:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 关上门 - 我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Close it! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.02,1:33:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.49,1:33:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父 愿人都尊你的名为圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Father who art in heaven, hallowed be Thy name.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.53,1:33:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你的国降临 愿你的旨意行在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thy kingdom come, Thy will be done,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.08,1:33:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同行在天上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on earth as it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.41,1:33:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她放进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put her in!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.87,1:33:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们日用的饮食 今日赐给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us this day our daily bread,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.87,1:33:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免我们的债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and forgive us for our trespasses,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.91,1:33:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同我们免了人的债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we forgive those who trespassed against us,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.88,1:33:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不叫我们遇见试探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lead us not into temptation,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.13,1:33:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我们脱离凶恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but deliver us from evil...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.30,1:33:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.56,1:33:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.40,1:33:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪恶已经被压抑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evil has been contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.53,1:33:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.07,1:33:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们还好吗 - 我们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you guys okay? - Yeah. We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.49,1:33:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你还好吗 - 不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.87,1:34:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有个狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a werewolf outside!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.00,1:34:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw the werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.33,1:34:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.92,1:34:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还救了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved me from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.26,1:34:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.43,1:34:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.64,1:34:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们该去别的地方好好聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should talk about this somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.16,1:34:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 各位 康涅狄格州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning from the staff of wpkw- pv6
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.33,1:34:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈特福德六台的观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Hartford, Connecticut.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.88,1:34:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是康涅狄格州的哈特福德 这里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Hartford, Connecticut, the land of steady habits...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.92,1:34:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.84,1:34:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 你们不该让男孩进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! You're not supposed to have boys over.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.97,1:34:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这应该根本不是重点 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's the least of our concerns right now, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.64,1:34:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 但我还是该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. I should probably still get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.64,1:35:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 快到返校节了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, um, so Homecoming is coming up
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.60,1:35:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想... - 好的 我愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and I would really like... - Yes. I'll... I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.60,1:35:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.27,1:35:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 如果沃伦夫妇没有先杀死我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, if the Warrens don't kill me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.44,1:35:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把一切都告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.86,1:35:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.74,1:35:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱蒂 你怎么这么早就起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy! What are you doing up so early?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.45,1:35:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get mad...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.99,1:35:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的车怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your car?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.04,1:35:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.54,1:35:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们享受自己的派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have our own party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.63,1:35:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.26,1:35:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 你至少能把那个东西拿下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Can you please take that off?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.64,1:35:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会一直这样的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't always be like this, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.44,1:35:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你迟早会找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, and sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.61,1:35:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理解你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll find people who understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.40,1:35:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于那个小安东尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as for young Anthony,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.65,1:35:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最好别让我逮到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he better hope I don't run into him anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.91,1:35:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.80,1:36:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.47,1:36:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.80,1:36:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.26,1:36:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的弟弟聊了聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, uh, had a little talk with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.85,1:36:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.39,1:36:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.19,1:36:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我男朋友能进来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it okay if my boyfriend joins?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.19,1:36:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.40,1:36:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们邀请我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, uh, thanks for having us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.74,1:36:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大胆鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob's- Got- Balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.99,1:36:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真大胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.62,1:36:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 朱蒂 - 生日快乐 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Judy! - Happy birthday, Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.74,1:36:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 生日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy birthday! - Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.33,1:36:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 朱蒂 生日快乐 - 欢迎大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, Judy, happy birthday. - Hey, guys, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.21,1:36:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直有人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.92,1:36:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐 朱蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.46,1:36:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 安东尼 - 我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anthony? - I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.71,1:36:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能参加吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I still invited?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.47,1:36:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.10,1:37:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniela?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.06,1:37:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.85,1:37:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.95,1:37:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发现这个房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found out the hard way
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.99,1:37:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有恶灵 也付出了惨痛的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there is a lot of evil in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.49,1:37:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你知道我为什么喜欢这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what I actually like about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.04,1:37:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的恶灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the evil in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.09,1:37:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都让我能够想起外界的美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reminds me of all the good that's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.73,1:37:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的丹妮拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.74,1:38:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是朱蒂和你说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Judy tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.30,1:38:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是你爸爸说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Your dad did.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.33,1:38:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还告诉我 他很想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also tells me that he misses you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.92,1:38:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再苛责你自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to stop being so hard on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.13,1:38:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那并不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause it was not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.39,1:38:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.40,1:38:38.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.78,1:38:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.11,1:38:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're young.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.07,1:38:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在你这个年纪的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I was about your age,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.20,1:38:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经和我的一任男友在没告诉我父母的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I once ran off with a boyfriend for three days
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.50,1:38:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整整偷跑出去三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without telling my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.08,1:38:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我释放出了一个恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I unleashed a demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.13,1:39:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这应该不是一码事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So not the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.59,1:39:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, okay. True.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.76,1:39:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃伦先生知道这一任男友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Mr. Warren know about this boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.10,1:39:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是那个男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.40,1:39:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人想听歌吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody wanna hear a song?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.03,1:39:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.59,1:39:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[纪念洛琳·沃伦]
